{"contract":"translation_contextual_v2","candidate_identity":"096d6dcb7af4d7620f8b593e0856ba53acce194bc153ea9f2bb8470c42a2176d","verdicts":[{"revision_key":"3d9af53400cdd8855deaf6c19d7fd92db52bc959ab6d0283ca0bba745ef07114","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"译文加入了原文没有的机制说明：「立即」、「施加者死亡后，该效果会在目标下次行动时结束」和「且能够行动」。冻结的证据只有 tome-orcs/data/timed_effects/physical.lua:1199 的 long_desc，它只写 eff.dam/eff.initdam/eff.fear，无法证明这些补充符合实现（来源 unpinned，envelope 也没给出可补查的 checkout 位置）。现有证据下这属于增译，需要源码证据或按原文删除。"},{"revision_key":"3e83fc6e2dd17af919c4543ad30044feadac58cceccf54b8e36cbc5bce2d658e","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"3ea7432fdc497a4ea6c5aa3355ab3ad5d8753c17135ed98281a508166137eb1e","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"第一句不忠实。原文 'use steam pressure to rotate a serrated metal blade at high speed' 的意思是用蒸汽压力带动锯齿金属刀刃高速旋转，译文漏了「锯齿」「金属」「高速旋转」，还凭空加了「造成严重伤害」。原文里的严重伤害只在下一句（severe lacerations）出现。依据：steamsaw.lua:37。"},{"revision_key":"3f212f5560c341b3abd1e2f62d3f4bb96789c0a2a5dab042fd84487f26ce7caf","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"3f25323adcaaee18cb1da4ff65edc16603f2e4dc96acf87a9c6b71e8dfde50dd","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"3f360a40151c0f7010299058e34e864675a2edc5c3f6e340952e9d1e0fb36847","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"3f615510ad2c3bc4317b27ac5244b73cedaa39b6e35fc49adbb6a9dcbe50be44","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"'...why, they don't require any skill or ability to operate!' 里的 why 是表示愤慨的感叹词，不是疑问词。译成「为什么，这根本不需要……」语义错位，读起来像在提问，应改成「哼／嘿，这些东西根本不需要……」一类的感叹语气。依据：quarry.lua:44。"},{"revision_key":"3f7dc08a6231aa1ce3694b034558c2da48adc26d7d56fe1fa4556051127e297e","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"'will not bother the Prides anymore' 指的是全体兽人部落（复数 the Prides），译成「你的部落」把对象缩小成玩家单个部落，范围和关系都变了，应作「各部落／诸部落」。依据：achievements/story.lua:44。"},{"revision_key":"3fbaffc6c45564dfb2682edb2af83f8b6277ac4ce200b1fa54643da7ad6d735f","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"第二句机制描述有误。原文 'This shot is a ranged melee attack but will use the ranged procs of your ammo as well' 说明这次射击属于远程发动的近战攻击（ranged melee attack），同时还会触发弹药的远程特效。译文「射击是远程攻击将会触发弹药特效」丢了「近战」属性和 'as well' 的并存关系，会让玩家误判它按远程攻击结算。依据：steam/other.lua:358-359。"},{"revision_key":"3fdf760cf825e565ef4e07929ef7ca323e1c211aaa73e5e4c6c8d8184b66c4cb","verdict":"OK"},{"revision_key":"402794d8b7692d8f0f6331ed047012b647b88e30beba44c72b1e28573145cf9d","verdict":"ISSUE","observation":"原文 'his big two handed weapon' 泛指大型双手武器，译文「一柄双手剑」没有依据地把武器缩成了剑，还漏了 big。冻结证据（sunwall-warrior.lua:134）没有表明该 NPC 固定持剑，应译作「巨大的双手武器」。"},{"revision_key":"4213d094165c3bd68764713adfbc8bc8cfa4a63de1883431d10868d900e9343b","verdict":"OK"}]}